<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">21022026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="500ms"/>
<s>The news.</s> <s>Nothing more.</s>
<break time="500ms"/>
<s>We're back in four hours.</s>
<break time="1s"/>

<s>Washington has offered Iran a deal allowing limited uranium enrichment if every path to a nuclear weapon is verifiably blocked.</s> <s>Iran has promised a response within days, even as the Pentagon finalized strike plans targeting Supreme Leader <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="xɑːməˈneɪ">Khamenei</phoneme>.</s> <s>The offer marks Washington's sharpest nuclear concession in years, and the coming days may determine whether talks or confrontation follows.</s>

<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>

<s>Military convoys are moving toward <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈtɪɡreɪ">Tigray</phoneme> three years after a peace deal required <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌɛrɪˈtreɪən">Eritrean</phoneme> forces to withdraw from northern <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌiːθiˈoʊpiə">Ethiopia</phoneme>.</s> <s>The original war killed around three hundred thousand people, and both sides are now openly threatening renewed conflict.</s>

<break time="600ms"/>

<s>Washington is negotiating a nuclear deal that would allow Saudi Arabia to enrich uranium without the enhanced inspections applied to other partners.</s> <s>The draft omits International Atomic Energy Agency oversight — the same standard Washington simultaneously demands of <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="tɛˈhɾɑːn">Tehran</phoneme>.</s>

<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In conflict and security.</s><break time="400ms"/>

<s>Israel killed a senior <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌhɛzbəˈlɑː">Hezbollah</phoneme> official in Lebanon's <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="bɪˈkɑː">Bekaa</phoneme> Valley and struck a Palestinian refugee camp, leaving at least twelve dead.</s> <s>Both attacks breach a November 2024 ceasefire, and <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˌhɛzbəˈlɑː">Hezbollah</phoneme> has declared armed resistance its only remaining option.</s>

<break time="600ms"/>

<s>Ukraine hit a missile factory over fourteen hundred kilometres inside Russia, striking the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈvotkɪnsk">Votkinsk</phoneme> plant that produces <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ɪˈskændər">Iskander</phoneme> ballistic missiles used against Ukrainian cities.</s> <s>Russia responded the same night with over one hundred drones and a ballistic missile aimed at Ukraine.</s>

<break time="600ms"/>

<s>Armed raiders killed at least fifty people in <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zæmˈfɑːrə">Zamfara</phoneme>, northern Nigeria, burning homes and abducting villagers in a night attack.</s> <s>It is the second mass killing there in a week, despite a recent American military deployment to Nigeria.</s>

<break time="900ms"/>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>

<s>After the Supreme Court struck down his tariffs, President Trump imposed a ten percent global duty under a 1974 trade law.</s> <s>Effective Monday and exempting only North American goods, the measure sets up a fresh constitutional clash over presidential trade powers.</s>

<break time="600ms"/>

<s>India and Brazil signed a critical minerals deal in New Delhi, as both countries move to reduce dependence on Chinese rare earth processing.</s> <s>Brazil holds the world's second-largest rare earth reserves, offering a significant counterweight to China's near-total market dominance.</s>

<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>

<s>Four astronauts will fly around the Moon on March 6, the first crewed journey beyond Earth orbit since 1972.</s> <s>A successful Artemis Two flyby would clear the path for a crewed lunar landing on Artemis Three.</s>

<break time="900ms"/>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>

<s>Chinese technology companies including <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈbaɪtdæns">ByteDance</phoneme> and <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ˈbaɪduː">Baidu</phoneme> are recruiting artificial intelligence and semiconductor engineers across California, with ByteDance alone listing over one hundred open roles.</s> <s>The drive complicates both governments' efforts to decouple their technology sectors and may undermine export controls on advanced chips.</s>

<break time="1s"/>
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</speak>
